<title>HONG KONG: ICICI launches US$100 mln sub FRN.</title>
<headline>ICICI launches US$100 mln sub FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>BORROWER INDUSTRIAL CREDIT AND INVESTMENT CORP OF INDIA (ICICI)</p>
<p> AMT	US$100 MLN COUPON     6ML+80*     MATURITY   10 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     *	    ISS PRICE  PAR	   RE-OFFER   PAR</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	 CALLS	YR 5	  PAY DATE   26.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG REPAYMENT  BULLET	DENOMS($K) 1,10,100</p>
<p> RATINGS  BAA3	 SALES LIMITS UK/INDIA/US 144A</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	   CRS DEF    YES**	 FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  INDIA	 TAX PROV   ---</p>
<p> FEES     60 BP AS   MGT,UND    NA	    SELLING    NA</p>
<p> LEADS    CITIBANK INTERNATIONAL, SBC WARBURG</p>
<p> NOTES    *STEP-UP SUBORDINATED FRN. COUPON STEPS UP TO LIBOR</p>
<p>	    PLUS 200 BP FOR YEARS 6-10 IF CALL IS NOT EXERCISED.</p>
<p>	    **CROSS DEFAULT WITH OTHER SUBORDINATED DEBT.</p>
<p>ISSUED OFF THE BORROWER'S GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
